      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然事务繁多，但依然经常关心\n学园内的一切。那天我见识到秋川理事长的\n心胸宽广。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b9e0b40f3cd87bbcbac6086dc2ffda0d7379c8b17e58d542339b9324266548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002002.json",
      "json_path": [
